To: linux-sh@vger.kernel.org

Hi,

I would like to wind down accepting patches for v3.18 and get the last pull
requests posted by the end of next week. This is in order for them to be
sent before the release of v3.17-rc6.  As patches should ideally progress
from the renesas tree into linux-next before sending pull requests there is
a few days lead time involved.

Accordingly I would like to stop accepting patches for v3.18
this time next week.
